@baseUrl = http://localhost:3200/api/v1
@serverToken = {{$dotenv SERVER_TOKEN}}
@codespacesCredentialRef = vm-manager235

### LAB-014: Ensure a Codespace exists for a registered VPS credential
# Requires @codespacesCredentialRef to name a Codespaces credential registered
# in the vps table. Returns 200 if a Codespace already exists, or 201 if one
# was created using CODESPACES_DEFAULT_REPOSITORY (default vm-manager235-1/test).
POST {{baseUrl}}/rpc/ensure
Content-Type: application/json
X-Server-Token: {{serverToken}}
X-Codespaces-Credentials: {{codespacesCredentialRef}}

{
  "provider": "codespaces",
  "machine": "basicLinux32gb"
}

### LAB-014: Unsupported action is rejected before credential lookup
POST {{baseUrl}}/rpc/not-an-action
Content-Type: application/json
X-Server-Token: {{serverToken}}

{}
